    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7500c572a569fde1b7c3f8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这般温柔微笑着的赛马娘名叫迷人景致。\n她带人亲切和煦。听说是旺紫丁的朋友――",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb8348ecd6c4b2ba8b6f1d8093a72ad625b0747a734e4d0e57062ec42561b215",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d4381368962cbcef2355a58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但也是斩获6场GⅠ比赛胜利的，\n后冠赛马娘中破格级的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "720354b8684bcae4cc208355cbeab562291d4e52d27d2fec9aa75b53d2e0fd82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2fee881e6991b4adda6a2f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "单论比赛层面，\n对旺紫丁而言无疑是伟大的前辈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "853ff27f41e0465d6231b5dda438a2090a7f89974b355411c597a8639667689a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
