      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以咱最近常找她聊些话题。\n嘛、基本是咱单方面唠叨请她听就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b4822b1a280230e76aa99ba3c51cf0b7ac0fb24ce79cae95675ec24cb123c4c",
